#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:4
msgid "RL Post-Training for VLA Models"
msgstr "VLA 模型的强化学习后训练"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:6
msgid ""
"`RLinf <https://github.com/RLinf/RLinf.git>`_ is a flexible and scalable "
"open-source RL infrastructure designed for Embodied and Agentic AI. This "
"integration enables **reinforcement learning fine-tuning of Vision-Language-"
"Action (VLA) models** (e.g., GR00T, OpenVLA) on Isaac Lab simulation tasks."
msgstr ""
"`RLinf <https://github.com/RLinf/RLinf.git>`_ 是面向具身智能和智能体 AI "
"的灵活、可扩展开源强化学习基础设施。通过这一集成，可以在 Isaac Lab 仿真任务上，对 GR00T、OpenVLA 等 **视觉-语言-"
"动作（VLA）模型进行强化学习微调** 。"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:10
msgid "The typical workflow follows three stages:"
msgstr "典型工作流分三个阶段："

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Data collection** — Collect demonstration data from the Isaac Lab "
"environment (e.g., via teleoperation or scripted policy)."
msgstr "**数据采集** ：从 Isaac Lab 环境采集示范数据，例如使用遥操作或脚本化策略。"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Base model training** — Train a VLA base model (e.g., GR00T) on the "
"collected demonstrations using supervised learning."
msgstr "**基础模型训练** ：用采集的示范进行监督学习，训练 GR00T 等 VLA 基础模型。"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:14
msgid ""
"**RL fine-tuning** — Fine-tune the pretrained VLA model on the Isaac Lab "
"task using RLinf with PPO / Actor-Critic / SAC."
msgstr ""
"**强化学习微调** ：通过 RLinf 的 PPO / Actor-Critic / SAC，在 Isaac Lab 任务上微调预训练 VLA 模型。"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:17
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:19
msgid "The RLinf integration allows Isaac Lab users to:"
msgstr "RLinf 集成使 Isaac Lab 用户能够："

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:21
msgid ""
"Fine-tune pretrained VLA models on Isaac Lab tasks using PPO / Actor-Critic "
"/ SAC"
msgstr "通过 PPO / Actor-Critic / SAC，在 Isaac Lab 任务上微调预训练 VLA 模型"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:22
msgid ""
"Leverage RLinf's FSDP-based distributed training across multiple GPUs/nodes"
msgstr "使用 RLinf 基于 FSDP 的多 GPU、多节点分布式训练"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:23
msgid ""
"Define observation/action mappings from Isaac Lab to GR00T format via a "
"single YAML config"
msgstr "通过单个 YAML 配置，定义 Isaac Lab 到 GR00T 格式的观测与动作映射"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:24
msgid ""
"Register Isaac Lab tasks into RLinf without modifying RLinf source code"
msgstr "无需修改 RLinf 源码，即可将 Isaac Lab 任务注册到 RLinf"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:27
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:44
msgid "**Data flow:**"
msgstr "**数据流：**"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:46
msgid ""
"``EnvWorker`` runs Isaac Lab simulation and converts observations to RLinf "
"format"
msgstr "``EnvWorker`` 运行 Isaac Lab 仿真，并将观测转换为 RLinf 格式"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:47
msgid ""
"``RolloutWorker`` runs VLA model inference (e.g., GR00T) to produce actions"
msgstr "``RolloutWorker`` 运行 GR00T 等 VLA 模型推理，生成动作"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:48
msgid ""
"Actions are converted back to Isaac Lab format and stepped in the "
"environment"
msgstr "动作转换回 Isaac Lab 格式，并在环境中执行一步"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:49
msgid ""
"``ActorWorker`` updates the VLA model with PPO/actor-critic loss via FSDP"
msgstr "``ActorWorker`` 通过 FSDP，使用 PPO 或 actor-critic 损失更新 VLA 模型"

