msgstr "检查点每隔 ``save_interval`` 个 epoch（默认 ``2`` ）保存到::"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:229
msgid ""
"The placeholders are configurable in the task YAML "
"(``source/isaaclab_tasks/isaaclab_tasks/contrib/assemble_trocar/config/isaaclab_ppo_gr00t_assemble_trocar.yaml``):"
msgstr ""
"占位符可在任务 YAML（ "
"``source/isaaclab_tasks/isaaclab_tasks/contrib/assemble_trocar/config/isaaclab_ppo_gr00t_assemble_trocar.yaml``"
" ）中配置："

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:232
msgid ""
"``<experiment_name>`` — ``runner.logger.experiment_name`` (default: "
"``test_gr00t``)"
msgstr ""
"``<experiment_name>`` ： ``runner.logger.experiment_name`` （默认 ``test_gr00t``"
" ）"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:233
msgid "``<N>`` — increments every ``runner.save_interval`` epochs"
msgstr "``<N>`` ：每隔 ``runner.save_interval`` 个 epoch 增加"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:235
msgid ""
"The exact path is printed at startup as ``[INFO] Logging to: ...``. To "
"resume training, pass the ``global_step_<N>`` directory via "
"``--checkpoint``. For playback, ``--checkpoint`` also accepts ``latest`` and"
" ``best``; both select the newest saved RLinf checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"确切路径在启动时以 ``[INFO] Logging to: ...`` 打印。恢复训练时，通过 ``--checkpoint`` 传入 "
"``global_step_<N>`` 目录。回放时， ``--checkpoint`` 也接受 ``latest`` 和 ``best`` "
"，二者都会选择最新保存的 RLinf 检查点。"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:241
msgid ""
"Training throughput scales with the number of parallel environments. If your"
" GPU has spare memory, increase ``env.train.total_num_envs`` (default: "
"``4``) in the task YAML."
msgstr ""
"训练吞吐量随并行环境数增加。如果 GPU 尚有空闲显存，可增加任务 YAML 中的 ``env.train.total_num_envs`` （默认 "
"``4`` ）。"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:247
msgid ""
"Each checkpoint can be several gigabytes. To avoid filling up disk space, "
"increase ``save_interval`` in the task YAML so that fewer intermediate "
"checkpoints are saved during training."
msgstr "每个检查点可能有数 GB。为避免占满磁盘，可增加任务 YAML 的 ``save_interval`` ，减少训练期间保存的中间检查点。"

